	<div class="fsElement fsLayout fsTwoColumnWideLeftLayout fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8896" data-use-new="true" >

						<div class=" fsDiv fsStyleTwoThirds fsStyleColumn fsStyleColumn-1 fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_8897"  >

				<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_8900" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<h2>The Germantown Board of Education</h2>

<p><strong>Board Service</strong><br />
There are five members of the Germantown Board of Education, each elected at-large to serve staggered four-year terms. Officers are elected by the members of the Germantown Board of Education. Candidates to the Board of Education must conform to the eligibility requirements of the Tennessee Election Code.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<strong>Meeting Information</strong><br />
Regular meetings of the Germantown Board of Education are held each month at the Germantown Municipal School District Office Building (3350 Forest Hill Irene Road, Germantown, TN 38138) beginning at 5:30 p.m. during work sessions and 6:00 p.m. during business meetings unless scheduled otherwise.</p>


	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	
