		<div class="fsTitle " id="fsArticle_19019_321">
		<a class="fsPostLink" data-slug="gmsd-board-directory/post/andy-ellis" data-opens-in="popup" href="#">
			Andy Ellis
</a></div>

	







		<div class="fsSummary">
			<p>TLN Representative, School Board Position 5</p>

		</div>

		<div class="fsBody">
			<figure class="fsImage"><picture><img alt="Andy Ellis holds his surfboard and smiles." data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1734738294/gmsdk12org/t6kfdfyakaxjzfxcr2rn/EllisAndy2.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1734738294/gmsdk12org/t6kfdfyakaxjzfxcr2rn/EllisAndy2.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1734738294/gmsdk12org/t6kfdfyakaxjzfxcr2rn/EllisAndy2.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1734738294/gmsdk12org/t6kfdfyakaxjzfxcr2rn/EllisAndy2.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1734738294/gmsdk12org/t6kfdfyakaxjzfxcr2rn/EllisAndy2.jpg%22,%22width%22:1365}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="EllisAndy2.jpg" data-resource-uuid="ad8cb36c-b592-4bf8-b464-8aed34027e95" role="presentation" src=""></picture></figure>

<h2 id="ucContentPage_ctl06_header_h2HeaderText"><span class="accent-heading">Andy Ellis,</span> TLN Representative, School Board Position 5</h2>

<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff; padding:0pt 0pt 15pt 0pt"><span style="font-size:13.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#52525b"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Andy Ellis, a long-time Germantown resident, is dedicated to serving the students, families, and educators of the Germantown Municipal School District. Originally from Halls, TN, Andy earned his accounting degree from the University of Memphis and began a career in the mortgage industry. After graduating college and living in East Memphis for 10 years, he chose to make Germantown his home with his wife Leigh, and their three children: Runyan, Byler, and Emme Leigh.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; background-color:#ffffff; margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:13.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif"><span style="color:#52525b"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">An active member of the community, Andy enjoys coaching youth lacrosse and basketball, playing golf, attending University of Memphis football and basketball games, and spending time at Horseshoe Lake with his family. Passionate about education, Andy envisions a school system that fosters belonging, provides high-quality learning opportunities for all students, and empowers every student to thrive. His mission focuses on supporting educators, cultivating a sense of community, and ensuring a bright future for all GMSD students.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p><a class="button-solid-primary" href="mailto:andy.ellis@gmsdk12.org" target="_blank">Email Andy Ellis</a></p>

<p> </p>

		</div>


		<a class="fsPostLink fsReadMoreLink" data-slug="gmsd-board-directory/post/andy-ellis" data-opens-in="popup" href="#">
			Read More
			<span class="fsStyleSROnly">about Andy Ellis</span>
</a>
</article>
<article class="fsStyleAutoclear fsBoard-39 fsTag-50" data-post-id="322" data-authenticated-comments="true" aria-labelledby="fsArticle_19019_322">

	<a class="fsThumbnail fsPostLink " data-slug="gmsd-board-directory/post/harrison-coverdale" data-opens-in="popup" href="#"><img data-aspect-ratio="1.5003663003663004" data-image-sizes="[{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:256},{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:512},{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:800},{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1200},{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1365}]" alt="Harrison Coverdale headshot" /></a>

		
		<div class="fsTitle " id="fsArticle_19019_322">
		<a class="fsPostLink" data-slug="gmsd-board-directory/post/harrison-coverdale" data-opens-in="popup" href="#">
			Harrison Coverdale 
</a></div>

	







		<div class="fsSummary">
			<p>Student Board Representative</p>

		</div>

		<div class="fsBody">
			<figure class="fsImage"><picture><img alt="Harrison Coverdale headshot" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_1/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg%22,%22width%22:256},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_2/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg%22,%22width%22:512},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_3/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg%22,%22width%22:800},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto,t_image_size_4/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg%22,%22width%22:1200},{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/f_auto,q_auto/v1793195939/gmsdk12org/wscl7dg21y3hfpdnhqnm/HarrisonCoverdale.jpg%22,%22width%22:1365}]" data-resource-description="" data-resource-filename="HarrisonCoverdale.jpg" data-resource-uuid="dcf471fb-c735-44e3-9d66-f02f4df806e2" src="" /></picture></figure>

<h2 id="ucContentPage_ctl06_header_h2HeaderText"><span class="accent-heading">Harrison Coverdale,</span>&nbsp;Student School Board Representative</h2>

<p>A senior at HHS, Harrison brings an impressive combination of academic achievement, leadership, and community service to this role. A Houston Honors Academy student, he has completed rigorous AP coursework while remaining actively involved across his school and community.</p>

<p>His leadership includes founding Houston High&#39;s Ping Pong Club and Faith &amp; Fellowship Club, serving on the Pastor&#39;s Council at Germantown United Methodist Church as the youth representative, and helping plan youth retreats. He has also dedicated more than 250 hours of community service, including more than 160 hours with Mountain T.O.P. Youth Ministry serving families in the Cumberland Mountains.</p>

<p>In addition to competing in cross country and track, he is a member of the National Honor Society, Beta Club, Mu Alpha Theta, Houston Hugs, Fifth Measure choir, and the Youth Praise Band. This summer, he is participating in Vanderbilt University&#39;s Program for Talented Youth, studying Quantum Chemistry.</p>

		</div>


		<a class="fsPostLink fsReadMoreLink" data-slug="gmsd-board-directory/post/harrison-coverdale" data-opens-in="popup" href="#">
			Read More
			<span class="fsStyleSROnly">about Harrison Coverdale </span>
</a>
</article>

</div>

	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsLocationElement fsSingleItem decorative-rule   fsThumbnailOriginal fsThumbnailSmall" id="fsEl_19024" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<article class="fsLocationSingleItem"><div class="fsThumbnail"><img alt="Germantown Municipal School District logo" data-aspect-ratio="0.9491525423728814" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/v1728057263/gmsdk12org/kfsidmbhbsj6exiqodwl/top-logo.svg%22,%22width%22:59}]"></div></article>
	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_19025" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<h3><span class="accent-heading">Contacting&nbsp;</span>The Board&nbsp;</h3>

<p>Email correspondence sent to the entire Germantown Board of Education may be forwarded to appropriate District administrative leadership for a response or to the Germantown Board of Education Chairman.<br />
<cite>PLEASE NOTE: All e-mails sent the Germantown Board of Education are subject to the Public Information Act (Open Records), and the District may be required to release any e-mail correspondence with the Board.<span style="color: rgb(82, 82, 91); font-size: 1.125rem;">&nbsp;</span></cite></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsContent" id="fsEl_8737" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<h3><span class="accent-heading">Public Comment </span>(Citizens to Be Heard) Procedure</h3>

<p>Members of the public who desire to speak at the GMSD Regular Business Meeting shall submit a &quot;Public Comment Form&quot; to the Board Secretary&nbsp;<em>before</em>&nbsp;the beginning of the Regular Business Meeting. Public Comment Forms shall be made available to the public in the lobby outside the Board Meeting Room, immediately prior to the to the commencement of the Regular Business Meeting. (Delegations must select only one [1] individual to speak on their behalf unless otherwise determined by the Board.)&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align: center;"><a class="full-width-button button-default" data-file-name="PublicCommentform2023.pdf" data-resource-uuid="b4022729-f2d2-4cf9-8db1-65d345ae1286" href="/fs/resource-manager/view/b4022729-f2d2-4cf9-8db1-65d345ae1286" target="_blank"><span class="button-text"><span class="button-text"><span class="button-text">GMSD Citizens to Be Heard Form</span></span></span></a>&nbsp;</p>


	</div>


	</div>
	
	<div class="fsElement fsLocationElement fsSingleItem decorative-rule   fsThumbnailOriginal fsThumbnailSmall" id="fsEl_19024" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
		<article class="fsLocationSingleItem"><div class="fsThumbnail"><img alt="Germantown Municipal School District logo" data-aspect-ratio="0.9491525423728814" data-image-sizes="[{%22url%22:%22https://resources.finalsite.net/images/v1728057263/gmsdk12org/kfsidmbhbsj6exiqodwl/top-logo.svg%22,%22width%22:59}]"></div></article>
	</div>


	</div>
	



	</div>
	



	</div>
	



				</main>
			</div>
		</div>

			<footer id="fsFooter" class="fsFooter">
				<div class=" fsBanner fsStyleAutoclear" id="fsEl_9" data-settings-id="9" data-use-new="true">

